QuestGuidance.Register("en",306,{
[9761]="7004A652\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[9762]="7004A653\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[9763]="7005869D\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[9764]="70062239\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[9765]="70066E29\n1\tReclaim your armour\030Reclaim your ring\030Collect Elrond's writings\tYour belongings and Elrond's writings can be found throughout Tham Send in the Last Homely House. Elrond has prepared your belongings and also compiled writings on the Third Age for your perusal. You should collect them before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Elrond in Tham Send\tElrond is within Tham Send in the Last Homely House. You have collected your belongings and Elrond's writings and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[9766]="700376EB\n1\tDefend the Rohirrim engineers as they work on constructs ([see journal]/6)\tThe Rohirrim siege engineers are working to place traps and target finders to help in the retreat back to the Hornburg. The engineers will place banners where they plan to construct an item, but will be vulnerable to attack while they work, and will not complete their work if their banners are destroyed. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[9767]="70037AD2\n1\tTalk to Síric\tSíric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade, atop the raised landing. Thane Edric has sent you to speak with his guard-captain, Síric. He wishes for you to brief the captain on the threats you recently learned of and aid him in any way you are able.\n2\tExamine the notes and map of the Westemnet nearby\tThe maps and papers can be found on a table near Síric. Síric has asked for you to review maps and notes from other settlements in Kingstead to better understand the situation before speaking with one of his men.\n3\tTalk to Womar\tWomar can be found near Síric on a raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade. Having reviewed the notes and map on the table, you should now speak with Womar before returning to Síric.\n4\tTalk to Síric\tSíric can be found on the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade. You have reviewed the notes and map in the Mead Hall and spoken with Womar. You should now return to Síric to learn more of what is to be done.\n5\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade in eastern Kingstead. You have spoken with the guard-captain and one of his men and have been briefed on the happenings in the Westemnet. You should now speak with Thane Edric in the Mead Hall.\n",
[9768]="7004E6C0\n1\tCollect surveying equipment (total: 8)\030Collect expedition supplies (total: 12)\tYou should collect surveying equipment and expedition supplies in and around Skarháld.\n2\tEmpty packs and Zhélruka surveyors can both be found in Skarháld. You should deliver the surveying equipment to Zhélruka surveyors and pack the expedition supplies in empty packs.\t\n3\tReturn to Hórin\tNow that you have made the preparations he requested, you should return to Hórin in Skarháld.\n",
[9769]="70035023\n1\tCollect arrows from White Hand Orcs (0/8)\tGárnoth's Farm is to the south of Forlaw. A little down the road past the south gate of Forlaw is a path to the right that leads to this farm.\n2\tCollect arrows from White Hand Orcs (total: 8)\tOrcs seem to have recently captured Gárnoth's Farm. Most of the Orcs appear to carry arrows on them, and collecting arrows for Forlaw's defences should be a priority.\n3\tCyneberg is keeping Gárwig company in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw.\t\n",
[9770]="70028234\n1\tConvince Folant to join the auction\030Convince Cadvan to join the auction\030Convince Hevina to join the auction\030Convince Eva to join the auction\tMerchants can be found around Avardin, in the central Starkmoor. There are several merchants within Avardin that may be willing to attend the auction.\n2\tTalk to Bedwur in Avardin\tBedwur is in Avardin in the central area of the Starkmoor. Bedwur will be pleased to hear that you found several merchants committed to participating in the auction.\n",
[9771]="7000C379\n1\tTalk to Gandalf in Rivendell\030Talk to Frodo Baggins in Rivendell\tGandalf and Frodo are in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. Uncertain of the task he has set before you, Bilbo Baggins wants you to speak with his nephew, Frodo Baggins, and the Wizard Gandalf the Grey before setting forth on your journey.\n2\tTalk to Bilbo Baggins\tBilbo Baggins is in the Hall of Fire in the Last Homely House at Rivendell. Gandalf and Frodo warned you of the dangers found in the cavern in the dark. You should return to Bilbo Baggins with their opinions.\n",
[9772]="7003A68E\n1\tCollect wood (total: 5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades around Gapholt. You will need to gather wood from around Gapholt with which to build the barricades.\n2\tPlace barricades (0/5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades near the bridge leading in to Gapholt. With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.\n3\tPlace barricades (1/5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades near the bridge leading in to Gapholt. With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.\n4\tPlace barricades (2/5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades on the path leading up the cliff to Gapholt. With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.\n5\tPlace barricades (3/5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades on the path leading up the cliff to Gapholt. With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.\n6\tPlace barricades (4/5)\tThane Nothmar has asked you to place barricades on the path leading up the cliff to Gapholt. With the wood you gathered, you should build the barricades on the south-west and eastern sides of town.\n7\tTalk to Thane Nothmar\tThane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt. You should return to Thane Nothmar to see if he needs anything else done before departing for Woodhurst.\n8\tCollect berries (total: 8)\tThane Nothmar asked for berries that grow in the woods outside of town. Thane Nothmar asked for help gathering supplies for the men that will journey with him to aid Woodhurst.\n9\tSpeak with Nothmar\tThane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt. Return to Nothmar in Gapholt with the berries you collected.\n10\tTake Nothmar's waterskin and fill it within the water fall near Gapholt.\t\n11\tTalk to Thane Nothmar\tThane Nothmar is near the bridge leading into Gapholt. You should return to Thane Nothmar with the supplies you helped gather for the journey to Woodhurst.\n",
[9773]="7001C1C6\n1\tReturn the lockboxes to Candaith\030Collect battered lockboxes (total: 8)\tThe Bleakrift lies to the north and west of Candaith's camp at a split near the small stream separating the Weatherway and the Weather Hills. Candaith asked you to look out for anything that may appear to have value in the area of the Bleakrift asking that you return it to him.\n",
[9774]="7002ED1F\n1\tCollect Vale-ore (total: 5)\030Collect Vale-branches (total: 5)\tVale-ore can be found in the cliffs of the Vale, some distance north of Eaworth. Vale-branches can be gathered in the marshes just to the north and a little west of Eaworth. Goldwine has asked you to collect ore and wood to craft arms and armour with.\n2\tBring the ore and wood you gathered to Goldwine at Eaworth\tGoldwine is standing guard near the forge in Eaworth, south of the cliffs and marsh, in the Entwash Vale. You should bring the ore and branches you collected to Goldwine at once.\n",
[9775]="700372D0\n1\tCollect armour (total: 6)\030Collect shields (total: 6)\030Collect spears (total: 6)\030Collect swords (total: 6)\tSpears, swords, shields, and armour can be collected from yards throughout Stoke. Captain Grimmar asked you to collect spears, shields, swords, and armour for the garrison.\n2\tDeliver the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile\tThe armoury stockpile is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke. Grimmar told you to bring the arms and armour to the armoury stockpile.\n3\tPost conscription notices (total: 5)\tThere are places to post the conscription notices throughout Stoke. Grimmar wants you to post the conscription notices he gave you.\n4\tTalk to Huthric\tHuthric is outside the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Huthric and let him know that you have done as Captain Grimmar has asked.\n5\tTalk to Captain Grimmar\tGrimmar is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should return to Grimmar and tell him that you have done all he asked.\n",
[9776]="70036986\n1\tDefeat all Uruk bosses that guard the exit from the Glittering Caves ([see journal]/3)\tDismantle barricades, disable traps, and defeat the Uruk bosses set up on the path to the exit from the Glittering Caves\n",
[9777]="700380EA\n1\tDefeat all Uruk bosses that guard the exit from the Glittering Caves ([see journal]/4)\tDismantle barricades, disable traps, and defeat the Uruk bosses set up on the path to the exit from the Glittering Caves\n",
[9778]="70043222\n1\tDefeat Haradrim woodworkers near the Erui (total: 8)\030Burn bridge-rafts near the Erui (total: 4)\tHaradrim woodworkers and their bridge-rafts can be found along the banks of the Erui in eastern Upper Lebennin. Irodon has asked you to cripple the efforts of the Haradrim to expand the Crossings of Erui.\n2\tTalk to Irodon\tIrodon can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin. You have defeated many of the Haradrim woodworkers and burned their bridge-rafts.\n",
[9779]="70047D79\n1\tPick up the empty bucket (quantity: see journal)\tAnborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir. First, find an empty bucket to fill with water.\n2\tFill the empty bucket at Haerondir water source (quantity: see journal)\tAnborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir. Fill the empty bucket with water at the Haerondir water source.\n3\tFill empty water-skins (total: 6)\tAnborn has asked for help filling water-skins in Haerondir. Use the full bucket to fill water-skins.\n4\tCollect weapons from weapon racks (total: 6)\030Collect Ranger armour (total: 10)\tAnborn has asked for help packing up Haerondir supplies for the march. You should collect weapons from weapon racks and collect armour from barrels.\n5\tReturn to Anborn\tAnborn can be found in Haerondir. You should speak with Anborn.\n",
[9780]="7000D3D1\n1\tTalk to Crannog\tCrannog's ruling seat is in Aughaire, west of the settlement's centre island. You have been told by a Trév Gállorg warrior to present yourself to Crannog to be charged with a Fém, a respected tribal duty.\n",
[9781]="70027326\n1\tTalk to Golodir in Tûr Morva\tThe orchards of Tûr Morva are to the north-west. Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchards where several of the Rangers are picking fruit.\n2\tPick up a basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard\tA basket of apples near Golodir in the orchard of Tûr Morva is ready for carrying to Idele. Idele has asked you to bring a basket of apples to her from the orchard of Tûr Morva.\n3\tTalk to Idele at Tûr Morva\tIdele is in Tûr Morva. You have brought a basket of apples to Idele in Tûr Morva and should now speak with her.\n4\tPick up an empty basket near Idele in Tûr Morva\tThere are empty baskets near Idele in Tûr Morva. Idele has asked you to pick up an empty basket and carry it back to Golodir in the orchard north-west of Tûr Morva.\n5\tTalk to Golodir at Tûr Morva\tGolodir is in the orchard of Tûr Morva. You have brought back an empty basket to the orchard and should now speak with Golodir.\n6\tPick up an armful of wood from the orchard\tIdele is in Tûr Morva, south-east of the orchard. Idele is waiting for some of the apple-wood branches that Golodir collected from the orchard.\n7\tTalk to Idele in Tûr Morva\tIdele is in Tûr Morva. You have brought an armful of apple-wood to Idele, and she wants to speak with you.\n8\tThrow the wood on the fire\tThe fire Idele is using to smoke the meat for the journey south is by her in the middle of Tûr Morva. Idele has given you some wood to throw on the nearby fire.\n9\tTalk to Idele at Tûr Morva\tIdele is in Tûr Morva. You have helped to smoke some of the meats for the journey of the Falcon south and should speak to the fire-tender, Idele.\n",
[9782]="7002D6CA\n1\tTalk to Búkk in Tharâkh Bazân\tBúkk waits in Tharâkh Bazân for your return, awaiting any news of the battles from ancient lore. Arnod has asked you to bring the tales to Búkk, so that he may know the conclusions of the ancient tales.\n2\tTalk to Borgar at Jazârgund\tBorgar may be found in Jazârgund, along the path east out of Tharâkh Bazân. Búkk has asked you to bring the tale of the ancient battle to Borgar in Jazârgund, so that the story may be preserved for future generations.\n",
[9783]="70016701\n1\tCollect rubble in the depths of the Flaming Deeps, beneath the Cross-roads of Ash (total: 8)\tRubble can be found in the area beneath The Cross-roads of Ash, under the massive bridges that loom overhead. Stone rubble should be collected for the repairs of the Flaming Deeps' foundations.\n2\tBring the rubble to Ulfied at the Cross-roads of Ash\tUlfied is at The Cross-roads of Ash in the western Flaming Deeps. You should deliver the rubble you gathered to Ulfied.\n",
[9784]="7002F99B\n1\tDefeat Orc scouts at the camp to the east (total: 4)\030Defeat Orc ravagers at the camp to the east (total: 4)\030Defeat Orc defilers at the camp to the east (total: 4)\tThe Orc tribe has been scouted along the south-east pass leading into the mountains. Langfrith has asked you to drive back the Orcs encroaching on the lands south-east of Faldham.\n2\tSpeak to Langfrith about the Nink-hai Orcs\tLangfrith prepares outside the mead hall of Faldham, west of the mountain pass. Langfrith is expecting news of your infiltration of the Orc camp.\n",
[9785]="7002EF20\n1\tDefeat goblins at Thornhope (total: 6)\tGoblins can be found at Thornhope in the Entwash Vale. You should defeat as many goblins as possible to help satiate Béortnoth's thirst for revenge.\n",
[9786]="7002C8AE\n1\tThe Orcs dwell near the mountains to the north-west of Penda's camp. Penda has requested a search for evidence of his campmate's presence among the tents and crates of the Orc-tribe.\t\n2\tTalk to the bound Rohirrim\tFrithstan is bound to a pole among the Orc-tribe in the western Wailing Hills. Speaking with Frithstan may reveal the fate of the missing Rohirrim.\n3\tSearch the crate near Frithstan\tThere is a crate near Frithstan in the western Orc-encampment. Frithstan would you like to search the nearby crate for a set of keys.\n4\tTalk to Frithstan and release him from his shackles\tFrithstan remains bound in the western Orc-encampment in the Wailing Hills. You have found the keys that he has asked you to look for.\n",
[9787]="700525F9\n1\tPick up some wine for the north-east table\tJugs of spring wine can be found on the tables in the centre of the Festival Grounds. Arn Bulrush asked you to deliver jugs of spring wine to tables on the outskirts of the Grounds.\n2\tPick up some wine for the south-east table\tJugs of spring wine can be found on the tables in the centre of the Festival Grounds. Arn Bulrush asked you to deliver jugs of spring wine to tables on the outskirts of the Grounds.\n3\tPick up some wine for the south-west table\tJugs of spring wine can be found on the tables in the centre of the Festival Grounds. Arn Bulrush asked you to deliver jugs of spring wine to tables on the outskirts of the Grounds.\n4\tTalk to Arn Bulrush at the Festival Grounds\tArn Bulrush is waiting to hear if your wine deliveries brought refreshment to the parched partygoers.\n",
[9788]="7005112A\n1\tShoo pesky crows (total: 10)\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. Ermentrude Haybank has tasked you with shooing away pesky crows.\n2\tTalk to Ermentrude Haybank\tThe Wistmead wheat maze can be found in the Wistmead Harvest Festival space. You should talk to Ermentrude Haybank at the wheat maze entrance.\n",
[9789]="70025AFB\n1\tDefeat Elk at Tham Nambarth (total: 6)\tTham Nambarth is east of Tinnudir. Brogdagnir asked you to venture to Tham Nambarth and drive off the elk within.\n2\tTalk to Brogdagnir\tBrogdagnir is at Tinnudir, west of Tham Nambarth. Brogdagnir will be pleased to hear the ruins of his family are now empty.\n",
[9790]="7001BA79\n1\tHaudh Iarchith, Gwantham, Goetham, and Haudh Nogbenn are located in the southern Barrow-downs. Agatha Greendale has asked you to seek out one of three creatures -- Brishzel the barghest, the fell spirit Faegfaer, or Fergandir the gaunt-man -- and lay it to rest.\t\n2\tTalk to Agatha Greendale in Bree\tAgatha Greendale can be found near the Bree Hunting Lodge at the end of the Haunted Alley in Bree-town. You should return to Agatha Greendale with news of your success.\n",
[9791]="700375CF\n1\tTalk to Merewen\tMerewen, Burnoth's wife, is standing beside her daughter Céolwen. You should speak with Merewen regarding Burnoth's health.\n2\tTBD\t\n",
[9792]="70068BFE\n1\tCollect from Râhal scoundrel\030Collect from Râhal lazy-body\030Collect from Râhal drunkard\tZadok has asked you to help him collect on a few debts so that he can at least have enough to return to Gondor. Zadok's clients can be found wandering around Black Anchor, and the Baths.\n2\tTalk to Zadok\tYou have managed to collect debts from some of the Corsairs in the Gut. This should help Zadok make a respectable getaway.\n",
})
